n",content:"Content",courses:"Courses",profile:"Profile",usersname:"Customize Your Username",username:"Username",password:"Password",forgot_password:"Forgot Password",remember_me:"Remember Me",is_required:"is required",min:"minimum",max:"maximum",characters:"characters",Password_must_match:"Password must match",can_only_contain_letters:"can only contain letters",Choose_at_least:"Choose at least",cards_can_be_selected:"cards can be selected",terms_and_conditions:"Lastly, To ensure a safe and tailored experience, please let us know your age. Your response will help us provide the appropriate terms and conditions.",I_am_18_or_older:"I am 18 or older",I_am_under_18:"I am under 18","T&C":"Please read the following Privacy Policy by scrolling all the way to the bottom to enable the",create_account:"Create Account",button:"button","T&C_1":"Pratham Education Foundation (Pratham) is one of India's largest NGOs, with its registered office in Mumbai Pratham has worked in the field of education for more than 25 years.","T&C_2":"As you are aware, you are participating in the activities conducted by Pratham. In reference to this, Pratham, through its volunteers/representatives, shall collect your data which includes but is not limited to basic identification, location, contact information, learning related data, images/photographs, videos, voice recordings (the 'Materials'), while participating in the activities.","T&C_3":"The collected information/materials shall be used in part or in whole for the following purposes:","T&C_4":"1. Program implementation & improvement, community engagement, and reporting purposes.","T&C_5":"2. In Pratham's publications, donor reports (in India as well as internationally), media activities, social media activities (e.g.: Facebook, YouTube, Instagram, LinkedIn, Twitter, Threads, etc.), activities on digital platforms (e.g.: Pratham's websites). The same shall be used for creating awareness about educational activities.","T&C_6":"3. To share with donors (in India as well as internationally) in order to create awareness about Pratham's charitable work.","T&C_7":"You are requested to give your consent to collect, store and use the above-mentioned information/materials. However, as per your discretion, you can deny your consent for collecting your information/materials.","T&C_8":"I grant consent to Pratham, its volunteers and/or representatives to use, store, share, publish the above-mentioned materials related to me without any coercion.","T&C_9":"If at any point in time I decide that my data/photo/video should be removed, updated or rectified from Pratham's website or storage platforms, I shall inform Pratham's volunteer/representative via phone/email, which can be followed up by a written withdrawal/updation of consent. Thereafter, Pratham, its volunteers and/or representatives shall remove or rectify/update the same within 15 working days. In this regard, the contact details have been given below.","T&C_10":"I have read and/or been explained in vernacular the foregoing and fully understand the contents of the terms hereof. I hereby confirm my consent for the above-mentioned terms of use of my materials/information and will not raise any claim whatsoever in regard to such usage.","T&C_11":"Contact Details: Pratham Education Foundation",office_adrress:"Delhi Office: B4/59, Safdarjung Enclave, New Delhi-110029",office_email:"Email:dataprotectionofficer@pratham.org",office_phone:"Phone no: 011-26177200",office_website:"| www.pratham.org |",office_cin:"CIN: U80101MH2002NPL136300","T&C_12":"I have read and agree to the Privacy Policy and I consent to the collection and use of my personal data as described in the Consent Form.","T&C_13":"You can request for data deletion, updating, or changes any time from the contact details provided in 'Data & Privacy Center' in the profile page.",username_already_exists:"Username already exists",username_is_already_exists_in_keycloak:"Username already exists",something_went_wrong